Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: add OnePlus 8 Pro front
 camera

Add the Sony IMX471 driver and the front camera node, with a longer
power-up delay on the camera supplies so the sensor probes reliably.
Enable CONFIG_VIDEO_IMX471.

